 "bodyText": "R\nDataset\nChat\nSearch\nAgent\nMemory\nFile\nEnglish\n◐\nA\n⚙️ Admin\nSystem\nVersion\tv0.3.4 (parity v0.3.5b, rev e53cd56+dirty, built 2026-09-14T16:25:53Z)\nIndex\tweb/static/../index.json\nTasks (34)\nTASK\tSTATUS\t%\nParse e2e_paper.txt\tdone\t100%\nParse e2e_aquaculture.txt\tdone\t100%\nParse e2e_vision(1).png\tdone\t100%\nParse e2e_vision.png\tdone\t100%\nParse e2e_aquaculture.txt\tdone\t100%\nParse e2e_aquaculture.txt\tfailed\t100%\nParse e2e_aquaculture.txt\tfailed\t100%\nParse rayrag_dl_test.txt\tdone\t100%\nParse ocr_smoke(2).png\tdone\t100%\nParse ocr_smoke(1).png\tfailed\t100%\nSystem Variables\nDurable RAGFlow-compatible variables. Sandbox changes take effect on the next execution; secrets are never returned in plaintext.\nNAME\tTYPE\tVALUE\t\ndefault_role\tstring\t\tSave\nenable_whitelist\tbool\t\tSave\nmail.default_sender\tstring\t\tSave\nmail.password\tstring\t\tSave\nmail.port\tinteger\t\tSave\nmail.server\tstring\t\tSave\nmail.timeout\tinteger\t\tSave\nmail.use_ssl\tbool\t\tSave\nmail.use_tls\tbool\t\tSave\nmail.username\tstring\t\tSave\nsandbox.aliyun_codeinterpreter\tjson\t\tSave\nsandbox.e2b\tjson\t\tSave\nsandbox.provider_type\tstring\t\tSave\nsandbox.self_managed\tjson\t\tSave\nUsers (1) + Add User\nNAME\tEMAIL\tROLE\tACTIONS\nAdmin\tadmin@rayrag.local\tadmin\tReset PW Del\nModel providers\nReranker\n Enabled\nAPI Base\nAPI Key\n Clear saved API key\nSave\nRAG Chat Test\nAsk\nRayRAG provider administration",
